<title>USA: FNB Financial sets 33-1/3 pct stock div.</title>
<headline>FNB Financial sets 33-1/3 pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>REIDSVILLE, N.C. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>FNB Financial Services Corp said Tuesday its board had declared a 33-1/3 percent stock dividend, payable September 12, record September 5.</p>
<p>Fractional shares will paid in cash.</p>
<p>The company said the dividend will result in its having about 2.5 million shares issued and outstanding.</p>
<p>The company said the stock dividend, the third in an 18-month period, follows a 33-1/3 percent dividend paid on April 30, 1997, and a 25 percent dividend paid on March 29, 1996.</p>
</text>
